    "profile_text": {
        "body": "Shopify Inc. is a public company headquartered in Ottawa that trades under the ticker SHOP and is registered with the SEC under CIK 0001594805. On its own website the company describes itself as an all-in-one commerce platform for businesses, offering a free trial and tools to manage every part of a business rather than ecommerce software alone. It presents those tools as a way to build or grow a business quickly with AI.\n\nThe site's AI material centers on Agentic Storefronts, which Shopify says lets merchants be discovered across AI channels and lets shoppers check out directly in a chat without the merchant taking any action. That is the extent of the AI product detail the company's site provides in the harvested text.\n\nThe record holds no litigation, no tracked products, and no MCP servers for Shopify.",
